WEBVTT

00:10:58.299 --> 00:11:00.504
(Lachen)

00:11:00.504 --> 00:11:03.190
In Woche drei, Prominente --

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:06.586
Entertainment Tonight, Access Hollywood.

00:11:06.586 --> 00:11:12.741
Woche vier, weltweit --
BBC, Irisches Radio.

00:11:12.741 --> 00:11:15.663
Hat jemand von Ihnen
"Lost In Translation" gesehen?

00:11:15.663 --> 00:11:17.852
Mein Mann war
im japanischen Fernsehen.

00:11:17.852 --> 00:11:19.562
Es war interessant.

00:11:19.562 --> 00:11:21.614
(Lachen)

00:11:21.614 --> 00:11:27.376
Und diese Videos, die beliebten Videos.

00:11:27.376 --> 00:11:31.844
Paul Bissonnettes
Gletschervideo -- unglaublich.